cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research prototype, cite the software and the specific scientific sources relevant to your analysis."
title: "Auditory Inference Lab"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Jenaro
    given-names: Guillermo
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-08-30
url: "https://github.com/gjenaro/Auditory-Inference-Lab"
repository-code: "https://github.com/gjenaro/Auditory-Inference-Lab"
license: LicenseRef-Proprietary
abstract: >-
  A closed-loop iPhone research prototype for bilateral relative pure-tone
  screening, bilingual speech-in-noise and matched Standard-versus-EQ testing, predictive-listening behavior,
  uncertainty-aware left/right audio candidates, blinded comparison, and
  longitudinal personal preference tracking.
keywords:
  - audiometry
  - speech-in-noise
  - matched speech comparison
  - auditory neuroscience
  - predictive listening
  - psychoacoustics
  - personalization
  - blinded comparison
  - SwiftUI
